=C2=A0




=C2=A0

MiniMax-M2.7 is now available to run via Ollama's =
cloud. This new model is designed to excel at completing end-to-end tasks =
in
software engineering and office productivity while improving its =
character and emotional intelligence.
=C2=A0
M2.7 is also good at =
self-improvement using data from the web. This allows assistants like =
OpenClaw to do research and learn new
skills.
=C2=A0
To get started, download Ollama:
=C2=A0

Download Ollama [https://ollama.=
com/download]

=C2=A0
Next, launch OpenClaw with MiniMax-M2.7:
=C2=A0
ollama launch openclaw --model minimax-m2.7:cloud
=C2=A0
If you already have OpenClaw running with Ollama, switch to MiniMax-M2.7 =
cloud by using the /model command:
=C2=A0
/model ollama/minimax-m2.7:cloud


=C2=A0


Self-improvement & research

OpenClaw can now perform deep =
research tasks and use up-to-date web information to teach itself skills =
and best practices.
=C2=A0
Example: financial reporting
=C2=A0
Teach yourself how to write financial research reports by studying examples=
 from top analysts. Write a PPT presentation and Word
document report on TSMC based on their latest earnings. Save your research =
framework as a skill so future reports follow the same
process.
=C2=A0


Launch agents in non-interactive mode

Ollama can now launch =
non-interactive agents using the new --yes flag.
=C2=A0
This enables running OpenClaw and other agents in the background without =
interruption on servers, scripts, and other environments
that do not support the OpenClaw gateway.
=C2=A0
To launch a =
non-interactive OpenClaw agent, run:
=C2=A0
ollama launch openclaw \
--model minimax-m2.7:cloud \
--yes -- agent \
--agent main \
--local \
--message "Prepare a pre-read for my next meeting"
=C2=A0
=C2=A0
If you have any feedback, reply directly to this email or join Ollama's =
Discord channel [https://discord.gg/ollama].
=C2=A0
=E2=9D=A4=EF=B8=8F Ollama
